        "detailed_description": "<h1>Press</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“An artistic experience above all. It was clear that Bajka would also be primarily an audiovisual and emotional work, and the first impressions only confirm this…”</i> <strong>gamesquad.sk</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“The key feature of this game is that it demands calmness and offers something that might appeal to therapists seeking in the world of games something unconventional and visually beautiful, even without shining in the full spectrum of colors…”</i> <strong>zn.sk</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“A wonderfully enchanting new release from a Czech creator…”</i> <strong>doupe.cz</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“Promises a unique combination of dreamy visuals, innovative gameplay, and Czech artistic craftsmanship…”</i> <strong>games.cz</strong></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the fable of discovery and diversity…</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/5f8f1bc016b1ceb4fa00efbaf9071416.poster.avif?t=1787769537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/5f8f1bc016b1ceb4fa00efbaf9071416.webm?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/5f8f1bc016b1ceb4fa00efbaf9071416.mp4?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dreams of animals, from moments of peace to thrilling adventures. Let's explore the places where only traces of human presence linger. The decision of your destination is entirely up to you. Become a deer and run through a starry world of dreaming, where the past and imagination are blended. Meet different animals and peek into their strange dreams.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/3cc1b0c56e59e0bfd2fa0563100ce802.poster.avif?t=1787769537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/3cc1b0c56e59e0bfd2fa0563100ce802.webm?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/3cc1b0c56e59e0bfd2fa0563100ce802.mp4?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe this third-person adventure game will become your recent dream, too!</p></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the fable of discovery and diversity…</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/5f8f1bc016b1ceb4fa00efbaf9071416.poster.avif?t=1787769537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/5f8f1bc016b1ceb4fa00efbaf9071416.webm?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/5f8f1bc016b1ceb4fa00efbaf9071416.mp4?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dreams of animals, from moments of peace to thrilling adventures. Let's explore the places where only traces of human presence linger. The decision of your destination is entirely up to you. Become a deer and run through a starry world of dreaming, where the past and imagination are blended. Meet different animals and peek into their strange dreams.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/3cc1b0c56e59e0bfd2fa0563100ce802.poster.avif?t=1787769537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/3cc1b0c56e59e0bfd2fa0563100ce802.webm?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3033560/extras/3cc1b0c56e59e0bfd2fa0563100ce802.mp4?t=1787769537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe this third-person adventure game will become your recent dream, too!</p>",
